<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech IPF KB H1 pretax swings to profit.</title>
<headline>Czech IPF KB H1 pretax swings to profit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech investment fund IPF KB, managed by a unit of Komercni Banka a.s., posted a pre-tax profit of 107 million crowns compared with a gross first-half accounting loss of 422 million crowns last year.</p>
<p>The results were filed with the Prague Stock Exchange, which released them on Monday.</p>
</text>
